{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fc6afc106ed24599daf252451feb8626.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=48 height=73 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fc6afc106ed24599daf252451feb8626.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Banner of the Maid blends the deep, tactical challenge of classic Japanese Strategy RPGs (SRPG) with a stunning anime art style, set against the backdrop of an alternate French Revolution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget what you know about history\u2014here, the Maid's power can turn the tide of war. As <strong>Pauline Bonaparte</strong>, the sister of the rising general Napoleon, you must lead your troops to victory while navigating the treacherous political salons of Paris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Turn-Based Tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the golden age of grid-based strategy. Command Infantry, Cavalry, Artillery, and Skirmishers. Master the Rock-Paper-Scissors unit counters, utilize terrain advantages (High ground, Grass, Mud), and manage your ammunition in challenging battles that reward tactical thinking over grinding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Visual Feast &amp; Anime Aesthetics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully reimagined 18th-century France. Featuring over 30+ unique characters designed with exquisite anime aesthetics. Collect and command a diverse cast of generals, from historical legends to original heroines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Political Intrigue in Paris</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is not the only place where wars are won. Between battles, navigate the &quot;Malmaison Salon.&quot; Complete quests for the Royalists, Jacobins, and other factions to unlock special weapons, funding, and secret story routes. Your choices matter!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Progression &amp; Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your commanders! Customize your playstyle by experimenting with different combinations of unit classes and skills. Promote generals to advanced tiers, and optimize your loadout to face any threat. Bond with your generals to uncover their backstories and unlock their full potential on the field.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Promoted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/49d1c0b896476db3f3d30eaea0fd338f4ac65fa1.jpg"},{"name":"\u00e9cole Militaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/ba596879c0dc81244fc1927ff9d2983d185583db.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Tested","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/17b31c6806dfada4119416937469c9dc30786538.jpg"},{"name":"Legion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/e34aa5e42dffb0fd58bbd390289291f7f5f36dbc.jpg"},{"name":"Star of Paris","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/4089b4d24e50c976be5bc7d3e2af5e8cd41b6269.jpg"},{"name":"Les Riches","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/3cecfeeb08f490668e58e26475c77db0ebf07e19.jpg"},{"name":"Valorous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/4813cfc33eec50992233e6a102faa5b03dca36f3.jpg"},{"name":"Records of the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/2fa1105718a0246cc045ae03996178e776079bb8.jpg"},{"name":"Treasure of the Scholar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/866a845460ee09db8d65e1ff7cfad9becad3bb31.jpg"},{"name":"Mirabeau's Story","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/994730/4dfe023b9c21760ad8eb4805577bbc09a998a331.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/994730?t=1765959079","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765959079","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765959079","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765959079","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play on Phone","id":41},{"description":"Remote Play on Tablet","id":42},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/65d94c2499fc6abfab527e6bdc067fc8.avif?t=1765959079\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fc6afc106ed24599daf252451feb8626.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=48 height=73 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fc6afc106ed24599daf252451feb8626.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Banner of the Maid blends the deep, tactical challenge of classic Japanese Strategy RPGs (SRPG) with a stunning anime art style, set against the backdrop of an alternate French Revolution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget what you know about history\u2014here, the Maid's power can turn the tide of war. As <strong>Pauline Bonaparte</strong>, the sister of the rising general Napoleon, you must lead your troops to victory while navigating the treacherous political salons of Paris.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/fd4974b9bca29bf0aad2407d27c66d56.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Turn-Based Tactics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the golden age of grid-based strategy. Command Infantry, Cavalry, Artillery, and Skirmishers. Master the Rock-Paper-Scissors unit counters, utilize terrain advantages (High ground, Grass, Mud), and manage your ammunition in challenging battles that reward tactical thinking over grinding.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/05d8991b55031750e07e889e0fe6e2f2.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Visual Feast &amp; Anime Aesthetics</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a beautifully reimagined 18th-century France. Featuring over 30+ unique characters designed with exquisite anime aesthetics. Collect and command a diverse cast of generals, from historical legends to original heroines.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/13d2b2d31172ca8a1d0982ed177c14bf.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Political Intrigue in Paris</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is not the only place where wars are won. Between battles, navigate the &quot;Malmaison Salon.&quot; Complete quests for the Royalists, Jacobins, and other factions to unlock special weapons, funding, and secret story routes. Your choices matter!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/102bbcdff1f7c18ce827932436bf59a8.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Heroic Progression &amp; Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your commanders! Customize your playstyle by experimenting with different combinations of unit classes and skills. Promote generals to advanced tiers, and optimize your loadout to face any threat. Bond with your generals to uncover their backstories and unlock their full potential on the field.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.poster.avif?t=1765959079\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.webm?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/cfce220062850476dd734dc1d2b5755e.mp4?t=1765959079\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Azure Flame Studio"],"dlc":[1139930,996820],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/259d97ec35c7d02bec6d2e98f32babd03cddad8a/header.jpg?t=1765959079","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Developed by Azure Flame Studio. Published by 2P Games. 2P Games, Banner of the Maid and the 2P Games and Banner of the Maid logos are trademarks and/or registered trademarks. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/994730/722421/0503b353206f306de3c6734fecb1f32ed6d0e54e/1750605076/dash_av1.mpd?t=1720148866","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/994730/722421/0503b353206f306de3c6734fecb1f32ed6d0e54e/175